{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001883685","cik":"0001883685","slug":"draftkings-883685","name":"DraftKings Inc.","ticker":"DKNG","exchanges":["Nasdaq"],"sector":"Services-Miscellaneous Amusement & Recreation","sic":"7990","country":"MA","website":"","listed_years":3.5,"first_annual":"2023-02-17","last_filing":"2026-07-28","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001883685&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["DraftKings Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Miscellaneous Amusement & Recreation\", based in MA, and has been publicly reporting for 3 years.","It reported $5.7bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 16.8% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 42.3%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 27 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 16.8% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $1.6bn in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1883685/000188368526000020/0001883685-26-000020-index.htm","accession":"0001883685-26-000020"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 4 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1883685/000188368526000020/0001883685-26-000020-index.htm","accession":"0001883685-26-000020"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 40.1% to 42.3% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001883685"},{"text":"Net cash of $999.4m against total assets of $4.3bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1883685/000188368526000020/0001883685-26-000020-index.htm","accession":"0001883685-26-000020"}],"bear":[{"text":"About 27 months of cash at the current burn ($999.4m against $439.3m a year). A company that must raise is a company that raises on the buyer's terms.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1883685/000188368526000020/0001883685-26-000020-index.htm","accession":"0001883685-26-000020"},{"text":"Only 7 quarters of reported history. There is no track record here to speak of, and a short series flatters whatever the recent trend happens to be.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001883685"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.0% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1883685/000140443026000024/0001404430-26-000024-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 34.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.34,"consecutive":2,"current":0.423,"current_display":"42.3%","threshold_display":"34.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 2.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.02,"consecutive":2,"current":0.168,"current_display":"16.8%","threshold_display":"2.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you lo